#, javascript-format
msgid "We are Libre Software under the ${ agplLink }, "
msgstr "我们是遵循${ agplLink }许可协议的自由软件， "

msgid ""
"We decided to archive it as a timelapse with lossless encoded webm. Taking a "
"screenshot from the timelapse results in a perfect 1:1 representation of how "
"the canvas was at that time."
msgstr ""
"我们决定将其存档为无损编码的webm格式延时视频。从延时视频中截取屏幕截图，可以"
"完美地 1:1 还原当时画布的状态。"

msgid ""
"We thank the following artists, who made their palettes available to the "
"public on"
msgstr "我们感谢以下艺术家，他们向公众公开了他们的调色板"

msgid "Weird"
msgstr "诡异的"

msgid "What the pencil should draw on the current canvas."
msgstr "铅笔应该在当前的画布上画什么。"

msgid "Whether or not this invite can only be used once."
msgstr "此邀请是否只能使用一次。"

msgid ""
"While we tend to not delete canvases, some canvases are started for fun or "
"as a request by users who like a currently popular meme. Those canvases can "
"become dull and inactive after a while, at which point there is no reason to "
"keep them and we may decide to remove them."
msgstr ""
"虽然我们通常不会删除画布，但有些画布是为了好玩而创建的，或者应喜欢当前流行梗"
"的用户的要求而创建的。一段时间后，这些画布可能会变得黯淡无光，失去活力，这时"
"就没有理由保留它们了，我们可能会决定将它们移除。"

msgid "Why?"
msgstr "为什么？"

msgid "Width"
msgstr "宽度"

msgid "Wrong Color"
msgstr "颜色错误"

msgid "YOU CAN ONLY CHOOSE YOUR USERNAME ONCE!"
msgstr "你只能选择一次用户名！"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "是"

msgid "Yes, really delete Me"
msgstr "是的，真的要删除我"

msgid "Yesterday"
msgstr "昨天"

msgid ""
"You are a teacher and a pupil is playing this game, despite it not being "
"suitable for them? Send us an email."
msgstr ""
"您是一名教师，而您的学生正在玩这款不适合他们的游戏？请给我们发送电子邮件。"

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"You are banned. You think it is unjustified? Check out the ${ helpButton } "
"on how to appeal. And don't forget to include the BID you can get below."
msgstr ""
"您已被封禁。您认为封禁不合理？请查看《${ helpButton }》了解如何申诉。别忘了附"
"上您可以从下方获取的 BID 进报。"

